# A68-A70 (our desktop, sd-base, no #Z): idle dump, hover the Desk title (22,8)
# to drop the menu, click "Desktop info..." (60,28) -> the Desk-menu form_alert
# (kernel/src/desk/main.rs do_deskmenu). Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up".
1100 mark A_IDLE
1200 park
1206 move 300 300
1400 move 22 8
1800 mark B_DESK_MENU
2000 move 60 28
2200 down
2206 up
2800 mark C_ABOUT_ALERT
